    <h2>4. Price Volatility &amp; Major Shocks</h2>
    <p>Crude oil is among the most volatile of all major commodities. The charts below show month-over-month price changes in both absolute and percentage terms, revealing clusters of extreme volatility around major geopolitical and economic events.</p>

